;;
;; Uses the "cip-prt" slug (not bare "cip") to disambiguate from Ecuador's
;; unrelated cloud-itonami-assoc-9411-ecu-cip, which already occupies "cip".
;;
;; SOURCE OF TRUTH for two derived copies:
;;   - src/association_facts.kotoba  (scripts/gen-kotoba-port.cljs, --check)
;;   - src/association/facts.cljc    (compared to the port, field by field, by
;;                                    test/association_facts_kotoba_parity_test.clj)
;;
;; Every entry carries :source-quote -- the verbatim span at :url that the
;; entry rests on. A URL that answers 200 and no longer contains the claim
;; looks exactly like one that does, so reachability alone would let a citation
;; rot silently. scripts/verify-catalog.cljs --live checks the span, not the
;; status code.

